From: Andy Zhang and contributors (see kernel/third-party/README.md for imported parts)
Subject: [PATCH 0001/8] SM4450 platform support

Clocks (dispcc/gpucc), power domains, interconnect, SMMU, remoteproc (ADSP/WPSS), RPMh regulators,
pd-mapper, TLMM, UFS PHY, SoC info, soundwire wake, LPG PWM and the sm4450.dtsi SoC description.
Mostly imported from the ROCKNIX SM4450 patch queue (see kernel/third-party/README.md), adapted to Linux 7.3.

Apply with: git apply (from the root of a Linux 7.3 tree).
---
